      "precise_scope_notes": [
        "Full42primary/74view/54freshM/14original source bytes and full241 Root floor retained. Main numerical branch uses independent Dusart density while retaining FKS3.2 explicit formula; not density-free.",
        "Frozen adapter only accepts top-level exit0 and a common env. One transparent orchestration wrapper supplies exact per-command original env and checks expected outcomes. All22 originals are declared nested routes; one wrapper is an additional orchestration CLI, total23. No mathematical program/algorithm/parameter/source is changed.",
        "Original audit.py requires repair-only OWN_REVIEW_INDEX absent from freshM packet. Its exact status1/stdout/stderr must recur; this is retained as an expected metadata failure, never numerical success. Original already-executed ancillary.py checks exact available own-history indices in both density modes.",
        "Each nested command emits actual full stdout/stderr with original argv/cwd/env/status into the deterministic bounded parent JSONL. Final child-output digest requires every one, all16 original current artifact matches, all source tables/density rows and110 full ray observations. No anchors-only or selected-branch acceptance. Partial output is preserved on failure and cannot pass the complete digest.",
        "Original parent replay timing/concurrency are not mathematical parameters; the wrapper executes full commands sequentially. All scientific originals use assertion-enabled workerPython3.10; helper acceptance uses explicit errors. Existing bootstrap records actual nested compiler output binary hash.",
        "Original mixed primary outcome, retired low-domain source mistakes, six retired proof variants, actual negative sufficient tests and transient reviewer reset remain historical evidence. This clean reproduction is ordinary numerical execution, not source-first PV, full analytic Lean, a new canonical study or overall exposure advantage."
      ],
