      "precise_scope_notes": [
        "Every63 actual freshM command record is retained. The original setup restore is provided by unchanged wrapper restoration (both exact original work roots); other62 commands are explicit, including the diagnostic exit1 source-layout attempt and its corrected success. The retained attempt source is selected only in a generated work copy, restored immediately after the exact failure check; original reviewed files never change.",
        "Original aliases cert.py/analytic.py/weights.txt are restored in both work roots. The eight newly compiled original binaries are required to match full historical build_bindings hashes before their exact-byte copy from replay_setup to exact. No precomputed binary or numerical output is substituted.",
        "All coarse invocations retain complete outputs, earlier failed cells and terminal suffixes; exit0 alone is insufficient. The old d02_analytic route retains conditional27/32 and retired direct-pi-square calculations as historical observations, not as valid current C020 premises. Current ram_repair/ram_high replacements and complete M outputs also run unchanged.",
        "The source-only anchor40 corrigendum is retained. It validates the same128 allowance with an existing PTpi/finite-theta proof; no private coordinator discovery or new mathematical premise is supplied."
      ],
      "source_job": {
        "path": "/data/ivy-d01-d02-final24-clean-metadata-20261119-_lr2yqig/source-tree/ieantn-d01-d02-repair-rerun-20261118/coordinator-private/portable-relocation-v2/expanded20-final-cases-preparation-v1/FOLLOWUP-C020.JOB_PLAN_UNSIGNED_V3.json",
