      "precise_scope_notes": [
        "The complete original31 scientific/compiler children and two ancillary checks run with full historical stdout/stderr hashes. Original dispatchers print randomly named temporary roots, so no false identical-parent-stdout digest is promised. Parent scripts remain exact sources; the deterministic portable plan transcribes every child at its original full parameters and historical fixed temporary root names.",
        "The replay-only LOCK.json is assembled from /task/CANDIDATE_INDEX by the same original method; original104primary/106review-view LOCKs remain unchanged. D01_/D02_ prefixes are stripped by exact byte copy. Original and repaired actual sieve stdout is passed as real stdin/argument to endpoints and mertens_new, never replaced with an anchor.",
        "All negative sufficient trials are inside complete extra_gap try/local outputs and remain negative diagnostics. Finite119 includes only original modes0,1,2; a weighted.303 diagnostic is not accepted at.25665. Decimal audit observes the unchanged sieve accumulators by the original ancillary insertion, without changing loop/algorithm/parameters.",
        "Root379 floor/247 old floor and all39 conditional antecedents remain scoped. k36 is canonical polynomial degree32 in G, not degree36; exact Root notation clarification retained. No source-first PV or complete analytic Lean."
      ],
